label Greeting
if {Transaction_HasReactiveOpener}:
	ReynaMayari: {Transaction_ReactiveOpener}

if {Transaction_VisitVar} < 34.0:
	ReynaMayari: Just strolling past as ordinary Maria. Your dusty little awning is ten times warmer than my palace hall.
elif {Transaction_VisitVar} < 67.0:
	ReynaMayari: No ledger business right now. I simply slipped out of Biringan to watch your shop bustle in the sun.
else:
	ReynaMayari: Biringan is spotless and terribly quiet. Honestly, your noisy street is much better company, shopkeeper.
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label Smalltalk
if {Transaction_VisitVar} < 34.0:
	ReynaMayari: Do not mind me. I am merely checking whether that top candy jar is still full. For official reasons.
elif {Transaction_VisitVar} < 67.0:
	ReynaMayari: Your regulars nod to "Maria" like I have lived down the road for years. I rather like that.
else:
	ReynaMayari: Drink water, rest your shoulders, and keep the sweets stocked. That is a sovereign's order, not small talk.
[end_timeline]
